		{"id":"325d0195903a6334","type":"text","text":"Rooms with blank books?\n\n[[Library]] ✔️\n[[Study]]❌\n[[Book Shop]] ❌\n[[Bedrooms]]❌\n[[Red Room]]s❌\n[[Schoolhouse]]❌\n\n[[Shops]]?\n[[Green Room]]s?\n[[Hallways]]?\nBlackprints?\n[[Outer Rooms]]?\n\n\n","x":2000,"y":6800,"width":260,"height":453},
