		{"id":"30a2b2e6909a914d","type":"text","text":"# A HIDDEN HUE\n\nFROM PRISM PRISTINE, THREE PATHS CONVENE,\nTHREE LINES OF LIGHT. THREE SHADES FORSEEN.\nTHREE COLORS TO COUNT, A SUM OF EIGHTEEN.\nBUT THE ONE LEFT HIDDEN, REMAINS TO BE SEEN.","x":1180,"y":7280,"width":440,"height":224},
